00:58:33.300 --> 00:58:38.360
<v Davy Rothbart>He didn't understand that he couldn't come out on the court when the grownups were playing, and I had to leave the game and take him home.
<v Davy Rothbart>他不明白当大人们在比赛时他不能上场，我不得不中止比赛带他回家。

00:58:38.360 --> 00:58:55.400
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass, back next week with more stories of This American Life.
